ZAPBench anatomical data
======================
dist/data/zapbench-centroids-71721.f32 is derived from the ZAPBench official
fluroglancer centroid file. All 71,721 positions and their ordering are kept;
original JSON floating point values were converted to little-endian float32.
No activity, connection graph or region annotations are included.

Attribution: ZAPBench; activity acquired by Alex Bo-Yuan Chen in the Ahrens
lab, HHMI Janelia; segmentation annotations by the CellMap Project Team,
HHMI Janelia; processing, alignment, segmentation and trace extraction by
Google Research.

